<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-20T13:19:56.389Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:19:56 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Plateau State killed nine civilians in an attack and bandits in Benue assaulted a farmer and later killed dancer Chris Brown in Makurdi. In Zamfara, troops foiled a terrorist attack on Kwanan Ayo and rescued two civilians, while bandits extorted N30m from the community and residents, including pregnant women and children, appealed for rescue. Bandits in the north turned against kidnappers, storming a hideout and rescuing hostages, and police are searching for the family of a Nigerian-Canadian man killed in a Lagos crash. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNRVg0aXlnWTRHdk81aU1LbThMMktiemtaa0hfRnk4bFdlZWs5aUVYVjlhMGVXVjZQOXNraWNRTGFGMTNFTlJ3aVFwWGUzREphRDRnNlljVE5xZmFkSlVrMDVSOTZ0V2R1VzNfSTNtcU91eEhNeU5teDVuM2JBLVFCaHppNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQSFpOU1ZOdVBNMEJWNDE4c0x2TzFZVGlvMEdwaW9UQlczenBELS1TMW1oaGkyQ3R2QzhQQXUtSkcwRWdlRzRIWXRJLUhka25fWXBkRTBNWmlzZE0xNTJYZnBuT3huR0xkNkE3M2FNMGhtY1RWeVo4a0wtVC0ya3VMdVpFR2luVnBoSVJSZ2d5R3k3ZEdwRWJLWTc0a0dmd3M0YWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPY1NBcjIzaUgyLTRMVWRvMDJlNGlBdF85VU9lODRoM01RZ1JjSEVSSnAwSHZBcFk3dDhZaHlqMjdsUnRPMHgyUWZEeldOUGppQU5UeEw0azBhUDJNc2xKeDJMOURBaXl5dHBVQ3NqeS02ckJkTWNsUHk3QmJSZEVhTHIySUxFblhOMlVBWGl0MTV2Z0Zhay00enlnOEdvTmx0ZU05bWxydzlEdWp2WjM0N2R2UGZRTWJDWVNFTjZUWUc1eVRs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPb3A4OVRpd2RqeU1TY21JR2tsQmFLcXU5RWEwbkpTLVpibGU4ZURIYlhEY09USE1Lal9ablJXajRwVEVIS0xxYzVHWmpRY3RkQmkwajNZUzJROWhZMm9TLTlRRlcyVzlGQXhzTjh6eGd5aFVvQXFCTW5jYWV6QVM2d1NMYnRPMG9iQVJz